<title>USA: GOLF-UNITED STATES RETAIN PRESIDENTS CUP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-UNITED STATES RETAIN PRESIDENTS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>GAINESVILLE, Virginia 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United</p>
<p>States retained the Presidents Cup by beating the</p>
<p>International team 16 1/2 to 15 1/2 on Sunday in the match</p>
<p>play competition at Lake Manassas.</p>
</text>
